# Settings > Screen > PDA mode at 320x480 (profile p320; study portrait-320, PR-E): the row is offered from short side
# 320, with the portrait canvas and NO writing band (the normal on-screen keyboard). The Screen section with the row and
# its value (On rotate right: the profile's rotate 0 while nothing is stored), the list of the three values and the
# restart question when another one is picked. Golden at 320x480 only.
title p320 pda mode
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text "PDA mode"
expect_text "On rotate right"
shot p320_pda_mode_screen
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text Off
expect_text "On rotate left"
expect_text "On rotate right"
shot p320_pda_mode_choice
key UP
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text "Restart the launcher?"
shot p320_pda_mode_dialog
key ESC
wait 300
key ESC
wait 300
expect_text "On rotate right"
